{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18260410","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826040001:":{"text":"もうこれ以上は待てないわ。","source_cn":"我快等不下去了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9608A58065F70DE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826040002:":{"text":"いつになったら修繕屋は営業を再開するの？","source_cn":"修缮屋什么时候才能重新开张？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3EE0A4742C6E81C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826040003:":{"text":"焦っても仕方ないだろ。","source_cn":"急也没用","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA89A755FF69A93F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826040004:":{"text":"何かお困りごとですか？","source_cn":"有什么烦恼吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F549C6DB956AEFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826041001:1":{"text":"どうなさったのですか？何かお悩みのようですが……","source_cn":"两位贵族朋友，你们在为什么事而烦恼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E608D73762A66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826041002:1":{"text":"それに、今、修繕屋とおっしゃいましたか？もしや、新鮮なパーツが足りていないのでしょうか？","source_cn":"我似乎隐约听你们提到了修缮屋……莫非是因为缺少新鲜的断肢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8120661A640063B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826041003:1":{"text":"ああ、いえ。ノヴァリスのパーツ不足はとっくに解決しています。今は医師がいないのが問題でして……","source_cn":"不，诺珐斯早已不缺肢体供给。现在的问题是没有医师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B76064C43459F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826041004:1":{"text":"修繕屋にはムン婆という医師がいたのですが、指名手配されてからずっと行方知れずなんです。","source_cn":"修缮屋以前的医师是穆婆婆，但她被通缉以后，就莫名其妙地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD509D3A8D40204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826041005:1":{"text":"領主様も、なぜ後任を遣わさないのかしら……膝と手首はまだ大丈夫ですけど、目はもうこれ以上待てませんわ！","source_cn":"不知道为何，领主阁下也没有派遣新的医师接手修缮屋……我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11A5710539503814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826041006:1":{"text":"ほう？ノヴァリスには他に医師がいらっしゃらないのですか？","source_cn":"哦？诺珐斯城内难道没有其他医师了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA81F303E19747A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826041007:1":{"text":"もちろんいますよ。ただ、ムン婆の技術は別格なんです。なにせ、唯一領主様の公認を得ている医師ですからね。","source_cn":"自然是有的，只是他们的技术都不如穆婆婆精湛。毕竟她是唯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D55192935F98811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826041008:1":{"text":"貴族である私が、認可も得ていない粗末な工房で手術を受けるなんて、あり得ませんわ。","source_cn":"身为贵族，我是绝不会去那些黑心小作坊接受手术的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE93BAAF7D8442713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826041009:1":{"text":"そういうことでしたか……","source_cn":"原来是这样啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6B5AC663AFF32A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826041010:1":{"text":"ご安心ください。<style=\"highlight\">ノヴァリスの現状は、私からトーラン陛下に書状でご報告しましょう</style>。じきに腕利きの医師が来て、貴方の力になってくれるはずです。","source_cn":"请放心，我的贵族朋友。<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8147221D2A388DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826041011:1":{"text":"まあ、本当ですか？なんて親切なお方でしょう！","source_cn":"哦，真的吗？您可真是一位热心的绅士！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x877758B124082D7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826041012:1":{"text":"ふふっ……ええ、私は「親切」が大好きなのですよ。","source_cn":"呵呵……我的确很喜欢“热心”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92012DF1A744A798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826041013:1":{"text":"そのお召し物を見るに、バンティスの貴族の方でしょうか？よろしければ、新月の夜に新居祝いのパーティーを開催するので、ぜひお越しください。","source_cn":"这位先生，看您的打扮，应该是来自班题斯的贵族吧？如果您...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF32E4FB9A5A604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826041014:1":{"text":"あなたのような紳士とお近づきになれる機会なんて、そうそうありませんから。","source_cn":"毕竟，能结交您这样的绅士的机会可不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82C564F77A63B00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826041015:1":{"text":"そのようなお誘いをいただけるとは、身に余る光栄です。","source_cn":"能收到你的邀请，真是我的无上荣幸啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1929C85C90656CFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1826041016:1":{"text":"このあと少々予定がありましてね。そちらを済ませましたら、必ずお屋敷へ伺わせていただきます。","source_cn":"我稍后还有安排，等我的事情结束后，一定前往你的府邸拜访。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCFD6293FFDEC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1826041017:1":{"text":"スレーザー様……","source_cn":"斯莱泽先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4A808F7056BC2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1826041018:1":{"text":"それは良かった！こちらが私の屋敷の住所です。","source_cn":"——真是太棒了！这是我府邸的地址，请您务必收好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x722018E34387B76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1826041019:1":{"text":"それでは、お越しを心よりお待ちしておりますわ。","source_cn":"那么，我们就在家中恭候您的到来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB07DA70017EAB66A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1826041020:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1826041021:1":{"text":"いくつか気になっていることがあるのだが、聞いてもいいかな？","source_cn":"我有一些疑问，不知道你能否为我解答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AE2922FFB470087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1826041022:1":{"text":"修繕屋にいた、ムン婆という医師……指名手配されたそうだが、彼女は今どこに？近衛軍が逮捕したのか？","source_cn":"修缮屋原来的医生——那个被通缉的穆婆婆，她去哪了？禁卫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF434E44B252E5A89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1826041023:1":{"text":"申し訳ありません。私が担当しているのは荘園内のことですので、街の事情までは詳しくなく……","source_cn":"我只负责莫蒂默庄园内的事务，不清楚城内政务。请您谅解。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF167080C3B72A1B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1826041024:1":{"text":"なら質問を変えよう。ムン婆が失踪して久しいのに、なぜ後任の医師を任命しないのだ？それとも、今のテペシュ様には、それすら難しいと……？","source_cn":"那么我换个问题。为什么穆婆婆失踪了多日，新医师还没有上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5152FC71CA7A43D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1826041025:0":{"text":"难不成……<u><link=Case><style=highlight>她出了什么意外？</style></link></u>","source_cn":"难不成……<u><link=Case><style=h...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1EF30CDC016114B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1826041026:1":{"text":"ご心配には及びません。領主様はお変わりなくお過ごしです。ただ、ここ最近は政務に追われ、そこまで手が回らないだけです。","source_cn":"您多虑了，领主阁下一切安好。只是因为最近政务繁忙，很多...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2D6A8CC745BDC52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1826041027:1":{"text":"つまり、彼女が怠けているせいだと言いたいのかな？","source_cn":"你是想告诉我，是因为她太懒了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0076454514DA87B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1826041028:1":{"text":"領主様のお人柄については、今さら申し上げるまでもないかと。","source_cn":"领主阁下的心性，有目共睹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E96B6613AE5A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1826041029:1":{"text":"ふむ……そう言われては、私も反論できないな。","source_cn":"是啊……所以才能令我无从反驳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00A5D7BB750789CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1826041030:1":{"text":"では行こうか。<style=\"highlight\">もう少し街を案内してくれ</style>。まだ気になることがたくさんあるのでね。","source_cn":"走吧，<style=highlight>再带我四处逛逛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB16825F4BC75D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:18060131:0":{"text":"ノヴァリスの街中、修繕屋が閉鎖されたことで、二人の貴族が頭を悩ませていた。スレーザーはそんな二人に親身なふりをして近づき、情報を引き出そうとした。","source_cn":"诺珐斯城内，两位贵族正因修缮屋的关闭而烦心不已。斯莱泽...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C919C914D79CF3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族伊默金":{"text":"貴族のイモルジェン","source":"贵族伊默金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族昆廷":{"text":"貴族のクンティン","source":"贵族昆廷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"スレーザー","source"